meta {
  name: List My Cancellation Requests
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/seat-cancellations
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{studentAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  All of the authenticated student's own seat cancellation requests,
  newest first (no pagination — a student realistically has very few of
  these ever).

  Each row includes currentPhase (1-5, the college's review progress) and,
  once the college schedules the mandatory exit counseling (Phase 2):
  scheduledAt (ISO datetime) and meetingUrl (the Google Meet link) — null
  until scheduled, and meetingUrl can stay null even after scheduling if
  Meet generation failed/wasn't configured (best-effort on the college-admin
  side, never blocks scheduling).
}
